{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29320","headline":"和孙朴韦蟾孔雀咏 · 李商隐","name":"和孙朴韦蟾孔雀咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此去三梁远，今来万里携。\n西施因网得，秦客被花迷。\n可在青鹦鹉，非关碧野鸡。\n约眉怜翠羽，刮目想金篦。\n瘴气笼飞远，蛮花向坐低。\n轻於赵皇后，贵极楚悬黎。\n都护矜罗幕，佳人炫绣袿。\n屏风临烛扣，扞拨倚香脐。\n旧思牵云叶，新愁待雪泥。\n爱堪通梦寐，画得不端倪。\n地锦排苍雁，帘钉镂白犀。\n曙霞星斗外，凉月露盘西。\n妬好休夸舞，经寒且少啼。\n红楼三十级，稳稳上丹梯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29320.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29320","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}